      ],
      "text": "A doctor on a podcast says GLP-1 drugs should go \"in the water.\"\n\nI'm not buying the hype. At my age, the questions that matter are simple: am I keeping my muscle, am I eating enough protein, and what happens when I stop?\n\nAsk those before you ask what the scale says.",
